config ONTHE15_LIGHTING_STARTUP
    bool "On the 15 power-up lighting intro"
    default n
    depends on ZMK_MATRIX_LIGHTING
    help
      Play the six-LED underglow ripple when the LED domain comes up, then
      hand over to the saved effect. The pattern assumes the On the 15 edge
      underglow: three LEDs on the left and three on the right, in symmetric
      pairs.
